  idleFrameRate: 12
  description: Fragile but versatile, the Mage uses light, healing and cleansing
    to keep the night under control.
  transformationMethod: The starting form.
  transformationPotionSprites: []
  transformationHint: 
  cureMethod: Your natural form. There is no transformation to reverse.
  immunePotionSprites: []
  spells:
  - nome: Light
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 59d21fb437c9db24c9e9ebe2838a386d, type: 3}
    costo: 1
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1b7e4d30089aac4bb39f5af0c9abcf3, type: 3}
    audioClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: bed9b09bbb16a3445aff57062ef18be3, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7d4b10e7e32123e4cabe243f730b67d5, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f7b0e9df5d2fb246ba0980d22b1b25d, type: 3}
    descrizioneGenerica: A guiding flame that pushes back the darkness.
    descrizioneNormale: 'Raises light intensity by 1 level (maximum: 3).'
    descrizionePotenziata: At light level 3, casting is blocked and no mana is spent.
    descrizioneBreve: Raise light by 1 level.
  - nome: Heal
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5cd7861c3b4c54b4b9323f5cc6c6e3ed, type: 3}
    costo: 4
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1b7e4d30089aac4bb39f5af0c9abcf3, type: 3}
    audioClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d2b3cd060fd2954386be75c2188ed0b, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a87f3ae2399037b4ab892dc5b684881d, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2b7f6e757aead5143a4d667343a2857d, type: 3}
    descrizioneGenerica: Restorative magic that mends the Mage's wounds.
    descrizioneNormale: Restores 3 HP. Cannot be cast at full health.
    descrizionePotenziata: 'At light level 3: restores 4 HP instead of 3.'
    descrizioneBreve: Heal 3 HP; 4 at full light.
  - nome: Cleanse
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bd969a873597b14448c3e80f9e73f4c8, type: 3}
    costo: 6
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1b7e4d30089aac4bb39f5af0c9abcf3, type: 3}
    audioClips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c050901ca4ec64d4d9f27002b52dc71c, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: e27f8c105c12d1745979db6699149323, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: d6d9e10a4f622a54abd74cab622a3fb2, type: 3}
    descrizioneGenerica: Purifying light that washes harmful ailments away.
    descrizioneNormale: Removes Burn, Grass, Wet, Ice, Poison and Grounded. Does
      not remove Algae, Bless or Curse. Requires at least one removable status.
    descrizionePotenziata: 'At light level 3: removes the same statuses and restores
      1 HP.'
    descrizioneBreve: Remove basic ailments; +1 HP at full light.
